1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
BriefCheck: turn a scattered brief into an acceptance checklist.
Local rules. English and Chinese. No runtime AI service.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Trace source facts and keep missing details unresolved.
Optional work stays outside the agreed scope.

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Edit the acceptance criteria before confirming a deliverable.
Suggestions are not client agreements.

4
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Record clarification separately from the original source.
The unanswered-question count updates as you work.

5
00:00:51,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Revise the source and regenerate: compare changed facts.
Matching edits remain; confirmation resets after a source change.

6
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Keep separate local projects and switch between them.
Up to 20 projects in this browser.

7
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Export and import a portable JSON project.
Source facts are rechecked on import.

8
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Export a standalone client preview with no external assets.
Review the source, scope and confirmation state together.

9
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:08,000
The workspace also adapts to a narrow mobile viewport.
No signatures, payments or legal guarantees are provided.
